ards of the Coast</a>), p. 114. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-6515-0\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-6515-0\">0-7869-6515-0</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Connections\">Connections</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Connections\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Griffon%27s_Nest?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Connections\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"border-box-runes\">\n<table class=\"border-box-contentarea border-box-contentarea-runes\" style=\"margin:0 auto; text-align:center; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" class=\"border-box-title border-box-title-runes\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uthgardt\" title=\"Uthgardt\">Beast Totem Tribes</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-box-content border-box-content-runes\" style=\"font-size: 90%; text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Lion_tribe\" title=\"Black Lion tribe\">Black Lion</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Raven_tribe\" title=\"Black Raven tribe\">Black Raven</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Bear_tribe\" title=\"Blue Bear tribe\">Blue Bear</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Elk_tribe\" title=\"Elk tribe\">Elk</a> • <span class=\"new\" title=\"Golden Eagle tribe (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR29sZGVuX0VhZ2xlX3RyaWJlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Golden Eagle</span> • <a href=\"/wiki/Gray_Wolf_tribe\" title=\"Gray Wolf tribe\">Gray Wolf</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Worm_tribe\" title=\"Great Worm tribe\">Great Worm</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Griffon_tribe\" title=\"Griffon tribe\">Griffon</a> • <span class=\"new\" title=\"Red Pony tribe (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmVkX1BvbnlfdHJpYmU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Red Pony</span> • <a href=\"/wik